<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to JACOB</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; background: #f9f9f9; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 32px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px; }
    .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #1D4ED8; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    p { line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .footer { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="logo">JACOB · BJJ</div>
    <p>Hi {{ display_name }},</p>
    <p>
      Welcome to JACOB, the team-room app for BJJ schools. Your team uses
      JACOB to coordinate rolls, ask technique questions, log
      conditioning, and mark milestones from first stripe to first comp.
    </p>
    <p>
      Tap into your team chat from the app any time. The sticker set in
      every conversation is purpose-built — `Roll Partner Needed`,
      `Technique Question`, `Recovery`, `Tournament Prep`,
      `Conditioning`, `Milestone` — so a quick log fits in seconds.
    </p>
    <p>Train hard. — The JACOB team</p>
    <div class="footer">
      You received this email because you signed up for JACOB at the
      invitation of your team.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
